  "description": "Tropical Vibe by Rayhaan is a bright, juicy, sun-kissed fragrance designed to smell like warm weather, energy, and freshness in a bottle. It opens with a burst of sweet tropical fruits—mango, pineapple, and citrus—creating an instantly uplifting vibe. The heart adds creamy coconut, soft florals, and airy freshness for that island-escape feel. The base settles into smooth musks and soft woods that keep the fragrance clean, fruity, and addictive throughout the day. A fun, youthful, tropical signature that fits perfectly in hot, humid weather.",
